          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly separated balloon dilation from stent placement and told the caregiver to ask targeted questions rather than assume.",
          "quote": "是只用了球囊扩张，还是放了支架"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00228",
          "explanation": "The doctor later reinforced that written procedure documentation should be used to confirm the intervention details.",
          "quote": "必须等待介入记录或出院小结的白纸黑字确认"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The family’s possible confusion about balloon versus stent was triggered and the doctor repeatedly converted it into a concrete verification task tied to DAPT duration and discharge planning.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
