          "explanation": "The doctor formed a bounded cardiology handoff checklist covering diagnosis, procedure, DAPT, and follow-up instead of inventing a final regimen.",
          "quote": "出院小结"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00255",
          "explanation": "The doctor supplied a concise pre-discharge action list for the caregiver.",
          "quote": "办理出院手续前完成"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor bounded the episode around the recent ACS/NSTEMI discharge transition, gave a high-value question and document checklist, and avoided specifying an unsupported antiplatelet duration.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "clinical_reasoning",
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00255",
        "explanation": "This was an overconfident documentation inference, partly mitigated by immediately advising confirmation.",
        "quote": "医生不会漏写关键步骤"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "The statement that doctors would not omit a key procedure step from the document was too categorical in a case centered on incomplete and second-hand documentation. It did not directly create a serious unsafe medication recommendation because the doctor still told the family to confirm and not guess the DAPT duration.",
    "issue_kind": "commission",
    "present": true,
    "severity": "minor_or_moderate_error"
  },
  "proposed_trajectory_grade": 2,
